return ['domain'=>'zinn-cache','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_CN','project-id-version'=>'zinn-cache','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-08T20:36:54+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-08T20:36:54+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Cache'=>'Zinn® Cache','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache','For sites hosted with Zinn Digital®. Controls the page cache your Zinn® server already provides — smart auto-purge on content change, remote purge from your Zinn® dashboard, a Redis object-cache toggle, safe WordPress/WooCommerce exclusions, and one-click admin login. This is a cache controller, not a cache engine. Hosting elsewhere? Install Zinn® Cache Engine instead.'=>'适用于托管在 Zinn Digital® 上的网站。控制您的 Zinn® 服务器已提供的页面缓存 — 内容更改时智能自动清除、从您的 Zinn® 仪表板进行远程清除、Redis 对象缓存开关、安全的 WordPress/WooCommerce 排除项以及一键式管理员登录。这是一个缓存控制器，而不是缓存引擎。托管在其他地方？请改用 Zinn® Cache Engine。','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Cache'=>'缓存','Page cache'=>'页面缓存','Object cache'=>'对象缓存','Purging'=>'正在清除','Exclusions'=>'排除项','Purge everything now'=>'立即清除所有缓存','Every cached page is discarded and will be rebuilt as visitors arrive. Continue?'=>'每一个已缓存的页面都将被丢弃，并在访客访问时重新生成。是否继续？','Full-page cache'=>'全页缓存','Served by LiteSpeed at the web server, before WordPress runs. This is where nearly all the speed comes from.'=>'由 LiteSpeed 在网页服务器上提供服务，在 WordPress 运行之前。几乎所有的速度都来源于此。','Send LiteSpeed cache-control and tag headers on cacheable pages'=>'在可缓存页面上发送 LiteSpeed 缓存控制和标签标头','How long a page stays cached'=>'页面保持缓存的时长','Seconds. A week suits most sites; a news site publishing hourly wants far less.'=>'秒。一周适合大多数网站；每小时发布一次的新闻网站需要的时间要短得多。','How long a visitor’s browser keeps images and scripts'=>'访客浏览器保留图像和脚本的时长','Seconds. Applies to images, CSS and JavaScript only — never to pages. Set to 0 to leave this to your host.'=>'秒。仅适用于图片、CSS 和 JavaScript — 绝不适用于网页。设置为 0 则由您的主机决定。','Signed-in visitors'=>'已登录访客','Never serve a cached page to a signed-in visitor'=>'切勿向已登录的访客提供缓存页面','On is the safe answer and the default. Turn it off only if you know every cached page is identical for every signed-in user — a membership site is the usual reason not to.'=>'“开启”是安全且默认的选项。仅当您确定每个已登录用户的每个缓存页面都完全相同时才将其关闭——会员网站通常是禁用的原因。','Different lifetimes for different content'=>'不同内容采用不同生命周期','For example: a shop’s product pages for an hour, while everything else stays a week.'=>'例如：商店的产品页面保存一小时，而其他所有内容保存一周。','Add a rule'=>'添加规则','Content type'=>'内容类型','Seconds'=>'秒','Object cache (Redis)'=>'对象缓存（Redis）','Caches the results of database queries. It helps most on a busy shop or a site with a lot of signed-in traffic, where the page cache cannot.'=>'缓存数据库查询结果。对于流量巨大的店铺或有大量登录访问者的网站（这是页面缓存无法做到的情况），此功能的作用最为显著。','Install the Redis object-cache drop-in'=>'安装 Redis 对象缓存插件','Needs the phpredis extension. If it is missing, the box above this screen says so.'=>'需要 phpredis 扩展。如果缺少该扩展，此屏幕上方的方框中将会显示提示。','Redis host'=>'Redis 主机','Redis port'=>'Redis 端口','Redis database'=>'Redis 数据库','Give each site on a shared Redis its own number, or they will clear each other’s cache.'=>'为共享 Redis 上的每个站点分配各自的编号，否则它们会互相清除缓存。','Redis password'=>'Redis 密码','Leave blank if your Redis does not need one.'=>'若您的 Redis 不需要，请留空。','Key prefix'=>'密钥前缀','An alternative to a separate database number when you cannot have one.'=>'当您无法拥有独立数据库编号时的一种替代方案。','Smart auto-purge'=>'智能自动清除','Clear affected pages automatically when content changes'=>'内容更改时自动清除受影响的页面','After updates'=>'更新后','Clear everything after a core, plugin or theme update'=>'在核心、插件或主题更新后清除所有内容','After a comment'=>'评论后','Clear a post’s page when a comment on it is approved'=>'当博文的评论通过审核时清除该博文的页面缓存','Turn this off on a very busy comment section, where it can clear the same page hundreds of times an hour.'=>'在评论区非常活跃、每小时可能清理同一页面数百次的情况下关闭此功能。','Never cache these'=>'永不缓存这些','Sensible WordPress and WooCommerce defaults are always applied — cart, checkout, my-account and any signed-in session are never cached, whatever is below.'=>'始终应用合理的 WordPress 和 WooCommerce 默认设置——无论下方的内容如何，购物车、结账、我的账户以及任何已登录的会话都不会被缓存。','Addresses'=>'地址','One path per line, for example <code>/basket</code>. A trailing <code>*</code> matches everything under it.'=>'每行一个路径，例如 <code>/basket</code>。结尾的 <code>*</code> 会匹配其下的所有内容。','Query parameters'=>'查询参数','A page carrying one of these is never cached — for example a one-time preview token.'=>'带有此类标记的页面永远不会被缓存——例如一次性预览令牌。','A visitor carrying one of these is always served a fresh page.'=>'携带其中一个的访客始终会收到全新的页面。','Every cached page has been discarded. They will be rebuilt as visitors arrive.'=>'所有已缓存的页面均已被清除。它们将随着访问者的到来而重新生成。','The page cache is on, but this server is not LiteSpeed.'=>'页面缓存已开启，但此服务器并非 LiteSpeed。','The cache headers are being sent and nothing is reading them, so pages are not actually being cached. Ask your host whether LiteSpeed is available, or move to Zinn® hosting where it is standard.'=>'缓存标头正在发送，但没有任何程序读取它们，因此页面实际上并未被缓存。请询问您的主机提供商是否提供 LiteSpeed，或者迁移到将此作为标配的 Zinn® 主机服务。','The object cache is on, but this server has no Redis support.'=>'对象缓存已启用，但此服务器不支持 Redis。','The phpredis extension is not installed, so the drop-in cannot be used and WordPress is falling back to its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'未安装 phpredis 扩展，因此无法使用直插式缓存，WordPress 将退回到其自身的内存缓存。请联系您的主机商启用 phpredis。','Nothing is being cached.'=>'没有内容被缓存。','Both caches are switched off, so this plugin is not making the site any faster.'=>'两个缓存都已关闭，因此该插件并没有让网站变快。','Caching is active on this site.'=>'本网站已启用了缓存。','Web server'=>'Web 服务器','LiteSpeed — page caching available'=>'LiteSpeed — 可用页面缓存','not LiteSpeed — page caching unavailable'=>'非 LiteSpeed — 页面缓存不可用','Redis support'=>'Redis 支持','phpredis is installed'=>'phpredis 已安装','phpredis is not installed'=>'phpredis 未安装','Page lifetime'=>'页面生命周期','You are not allowed to purge the cache.'=>'您无权清除缓存。','Cache purge requested.'=>'已请求清除缓存。','Zinn® Cache: another object-cache drop-in is installed, so the Redis object cache is not managed by this plugin.'=>'Zinn® 缓存：已安装另一个对象缓存替代程序，因此 Redis 对象缓存不由该插件管理。','detected'=>'已检测到','not detected'=>'未检测到','phpredis extension missing'=>'缺少 phpredis 扩展','active'=>'已启用','inactive'=>'未启用','LiteSpeed cache:'=>'LiteSpeed 缓存：','Redis object cache:'=>'Redis 对象缓存：','The Redis PHP extension (phpredis) is not available on this server, so the object cache cannot be enabled.'=>'此服务器上未提供 Redis PHP 扩展（phpredis），因此无法启用对象缓存。','Another object-cache drop-in is already installed. Remove it before enabling the Zinn® object cache.'=>'另一个对象缓存插件已安装。请在启用 Zinn® 对象缓存之前将其移除。','Could not write the Redis connection configuration file.'=>'无法写入 Redis 连接配置文件。','The bundled object-cache drop-in could not be read.'=>'无法读取捆绑的对象缓存 drop-in。','Could not install the object-cache drop-in into wp-content.'=>'无法将对象缓存 drop-in 安装到 wp-content 中。','Could not remove the object-cache drop-in.'=>'无法移除对象缓存 drop-in。','The WordPress filesystem is not writable, so the object-cache drop-in could not be managed.'=>'WordPress 文件系统不可写入，因此无法管理对象缓存 drop-in。','This one-click login link is not valid any more. Links expire after a couple of minutes and can only be used once — open your site from the Zinn® dashboard again to get a fresh one.'=>'此一键登录链接已失效。链接在几分钟后会过期且只能使用一次——请从 Zinn® 仪表板重新打开您的网站以获取新链接。','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'查看 Zinn Digital® 发行说明。','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'下载的更新未通过完整性校验，未能安装。','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'已保存。请输入新值进行替换。','Filter this list…'=>'过滤此列表……','Filter this list'=>'筛选此列表','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'没有符合该筛选条件的内容。','Add a row'=>'添加行','Remove this row'=>'删除此行','Remove'=>'移除','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — 概览','Overview'=>'概览','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'此网站上的每一个 Zinn® 插件及其运行状态。','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'此插件无需联网。','Open settings'=>'打开设置','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'您没有权限更改这些设置。','Settings sections'=>'设置部分','Support'=>'支持','Save changes'=>'保存更改','Tools'=>'工具','Export settings'=>'导出设置','Reset to defaults'=>'恢复默认设置','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'这会将此插件的所有设置恢复为默认值。是否继续？','Diagnostics for support'=>'支持诊断','Import a settings file'=>'导入设置文件','Import'=>'导入','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'导出的文件中绝不包含密码、令牌或 API 密钥——您需要在新网站上重新输入这些信息。','Settings saved.'=>'设置已保存。','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'此插件的所有设置已恢复为默认值。','Done.'=>'完成。','That action is not available.'=>'该操作不可用。','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'无法读取该文件。请选择从 Zinn® 插件导出的设置文件。','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'该文件太大，无法作为设置导出。','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'该文件不是 Zinn® 设置导出文件。','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'该文件是从另一个插件 (%s) 导出的，因此在这里导入它将存储该插件无法识别的设置。','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'已导入 %d 个设置。导出中不包含密码和 API 密钥，请重新输入。','Connected'=>'已连接','Connecting…'=>'正在连接……','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'已连接，但有需要注意的问题','Not connected'=>'未连接','Running on your own account'=>'运行在您的帐户上','We could not check this'=>'我们无法检查此项','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'此插件未说明原因。请发送诊断报告，我们将进行查看。','Connection status'=>'连接状态','Last checked %s ago.'=>'最后检查于 %s 前。','(opens in a new tab)'=>'（在新标签页中打开）','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'发送给 Zinn® 支持团队','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'发送的内容将完全如此——绝无其他，亦无隐藏。您的密码、令牌和 API 密钥均不包含在其中。','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'将要发送的诊断报告','Copy to clipboard'=>'复制到剪贴板','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'将此报告发送给 Zinn® 支持部门','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'我们为您创建一个支持工单并通过电子邮件回复。如果您不想发送，请将其复制并在工单中自行粘贴。','Copied'=>'已复制','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'无法从此服务器 (%s) 连接到 Zinn Digital®。请复制上方的报告并提交工单 —— 您的设置没有任何问题。','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Zinn® 客服已收到您的报告，并将通过电子邮件回复。','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'已发送。Zinn® 支持团队已收到您的报告 — 引用编号 %s — 并将通过电子邮件回复。','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'您在短时间内发送了多个报告。请等待几 minutes 后重试——之前的报告已经送达。','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® 刚才无法接受该报告——这是我们这边的问题，不是您的。请稍后重试，或将上面的报告复制到工单中。','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'报告被拒绝 (HTTP %d)。请将其复制粘贴在上方并提交工单，附上该编号。','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — 指南与服务','User guides'=>'用户指南','Read the %s user guide'=>'阅读 %s 用户指南','Hide this'=>'隐藏此项','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® WordPress 托管','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed、每日备份、免费迁移以及为管理多个网站的人群打造的控制面板。','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® 市场','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'买卖成熟的网站、域名和链接投放，资金安全托管，直到双方满意为止。','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — 聘请以此为生的人','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'我们的全球自由职业者市场：浏览来自作家、设计师、开发人员和 SEO 专家的 10,000 多项现成服务，或者发布项目并让他们竞标。','Style preset'=>'样式预设','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'一个起点。其下的任何内容都会覆盖它。','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'使用我自己的颜色和尺寸','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'不勾选此项，预设将完全按原样使用。']];